{
  "slug": "harnesskit",
  "name": "Harnesskit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Adaptive harness for vibe coders — automatically detects your repo stack, applies experience-level guardrails (beginner/intermediate/advanced), observes sessions via zero-token shell hooks, and continuously improves your workflow by proposing custom skills, agents, and hooks based on real usage data. Marketplace-first: uses existing plugins, customizes only when data shows a gap.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**, **1 agent**, **12 commands** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `apply` (Review and apply improvement proposals from /harnesskit:insights — presents diffs for approval), `architect` (Design agent teams for your domain using 6 orchestration patterns — analyzes project, selects pattern, generates agent definitions…), `dev` (Start the development server for the detected framework — auto-configured based on project detection), `init` (Generate harness infrastructure and toolkit files based on detection results and preset selection), `insights` (Analyze session logs, failures, and usage patterns to propose harness and toolkit improvements as concrete diffs), `lint` (Run linter and formatter for the project with auto-fix — integrates with HarnessKit error tracking), `prd` (Decompose a PRD document into GitHub issues and feature_list.json entries), `setup` (Detect project tech stack, choose experience preset, and initialize HarnessKit harness + toolkit), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (1): `orchestrator`\n- **Commands** (12): `apply` (Review and apply improvement proposals from /harnesskit:insights — presents diffs for approval), `architect` (Design agent teams for your domain using orchestration patterns), `dev` (Start the development server for the detected framework — auto-configured based on project detection), `init` (Generate harness infrastructure and toolkit files based on detection results and preset selection), `insights` (Analyze session logs, failures, and usage patterns to propose harness and toolkit improvements as concrete diffs), `lint` (Run linter and formatter for the project with auto-fix — integrates with HarnessKit error tracking), `prd` (Decompose a PRD document into GitHub issues and feature_list.json entries), `setup` (Detect project tech stack, choose experience preset, and initialize HarnessKit harness + toolkit), and 4 more\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install harnesskit@claude-community` from `ice-ice-bear/harnesskit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 4,
    "command": 12
  },
